{"n": 91, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "91.webp", "text": "M 20 B 25:\n\nOpen trunk tid.\n\nUnscrew cover (1).\n\nDisconnect battery ground lead.\n\nRemove trim panel in glove box.\nPull off plug (2) on control unit\nDisconnect plug (3).\n\nCars with Automatic Transmission:\nDisconnect plug for car wire harness.\n\nRemove coolant expansion tank\nPull off wire (4) on ignition coil.\nDisconnect wires (1 and 15).\nDisconnect wire harness,\nInstallation:\n\nUse a new squeeze-hose clamp.\n\nDisconnect wires {7 and 8).\n\nUnscrew positive pole (9).\n\nLoosen wire straps and pull out wire harness\ninto the engine compartment.\n\nInstallation:\n\n7 = Engine electrical system\n\n8 = Car electrical system\n\nLift out relay (10).\n\nPull off plug (11).\nLoosen clamp (12).\nDisconnect wire harness.\n\nUnscrew nuts (13) and remove air cleaner with\n\nair flow sensor\n\nLift out and disconnect plug (14).\nDisconnect wire harness.\n\nPull off vacuum hoses (15 and 16)\nDisconnect throttle cable (17)\n\nCars with Cruise Contro!:\n\nDisconnect cruise control cable,\n\nPull off vacuum hose (18).\n\ntnstallation:\n\nAdjust throttle cable — see 35 41 421\nAdjust cruise control cable — see Group 65.\nUse a new squeeze-hose clamp,\nScrew-on cap (14) locks in final position,\n\nDisconnect fuel lines (19 and 20)", "words": [["M", 0.2584, 0.0663, 0.2675, 0.0769], ["20", 0.271, 0.0663, 0.2827, 0.0769], ["B", 0.2852, 0.0637, 0.2893, 0.0836], ["25:", 0.2969, 0.0663, 0.3126, 0.0776], ["Open", 0.2584, 0.0829, 0.2842, 0.0955], ["trunk", 0.2877, 0.0836, 0.3136, 0.0935], ["tid.", 0.3181, 0.0836, 0.3323, 0.0935], ["Unscrew", 0.2589, 0.0995, 0.2999, 0.1101], ["cover", 0.3029, 0.1021, 0.3283, 0.1101], ["(1).", 0.3323, 0.0995, 0.3485, 0.1107], ["Disconnect", 0.2589, 0.1154, 0.3116, 0.126], ["battery", 0.3161, 0.116, 0.3501, 0.1286], ["ground", 0.3536, 0.1167, 0.387, 0.1286], ["lead.", 0.3911, 0.1167, 0.4124, 0.126], ["Remove", 0.2589, 0.3037, 0.2979, 0.3143], ["trim", 0.3014, 0.3057, 0.3212, 0.3143], ["p